    {
      "name": "places/ChIJbVbSLwCLaS4RUJwfviY1mKQ/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSbHRyZVJ3EAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Nice place to hang out with friends/family, small group or even large, they can adjust the table for us. Nice plating & good taste for indonesian menu, the beverages also good. For us, the AC is not really give a cool sensation, but still okay because the ceiling is high. Definetely will come back if have appointment in Cakung area.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
